VeridianOS: XCB's URL as ECM's FindXCB gives it

plasma-integration sets XCB's FeatureSummary URL to
"https://xcb.freedesktop.org", ECM's FindXCB (and Qt's copy of it) to
"https://xcb.freedesktop.org/"; each find_package and the project's
set_package_properties then replaced the other's value, and
FeatureSummary warned twice ("Property URL already set"). The same URL,
with the slash, ends that.

--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -56,7 +56,7 @@
 find_package(XCB COMPONENTS XCB)
 set_package_properties(XCB PROPERTIES
     DESCRIPTION "X protocol C-language Binding"
-    URL "https://xcb.freedesktop.org"
+    URL "https://xcb.freedesktop.org/"
     TYPE REQUIRED
     PURPOSE "Required to pass style properties to native Windows on X11 Platform"
 )
